{"3697200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Euclidean Night", "steam_appid": 3697200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Euclidean Night</strong> is a fast-paced, movement-focused first person shooter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARTH, Year 2207 </strong>- The world's governments have largely been &quot;sponsored&quot; or replaced by <i>Delta Industrial Enterprises</i>, a faceless corporation that specializes in everything from fossil fuel power and resource excavation to brain interfaces and combat robots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a member of <i>The Coalition</i>, the largest opposition to DIE, you've made yourself a large target for them, and they sure don't like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been kidnapped, had your consciousness torn from your material body, and imprisoned in a virtual hell. Break out and wake up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Showcase:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697200/extras/a4f8ef91c4728c1886f543602fff1a3d.poster.avif?t=1767592891\" width=600 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697200/extras/a4f8ef91c4728c1886f543602fff1a3d.webm?t=1767592891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697200/extras/a4f8ef91c4728c1886f543602fff1a3d.mp4?t=1767592891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skillful fast-paced movement <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite